{"resourceIdentifier":"3011","resourceName":"Mengzi MSW Landfill Site LFG Comprehensive Utilization and Power Generation Project","description":"Mengzi MSW Landfill Site LFG Comprehensive Utilization and Power Generation Project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Mengzi MSW landfill site (hereafter referred to as Mengzi landfill site), in A De Chong, Chenjia Village, Wencui Street, Mengzi City, Honghe Hani and Yi Autonomous Prefecture, Yunnan Province, P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Mengzi BCCY New Energy Co., Ltd.\r\nMengzi landfill site started collecting and handling waste in 2005.\r\nThe project started to construct on 20/06/2021. The project has a total designed capacity 2MW (4*0.5MW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the China Southern Power Grid. Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period will be 85,636MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project are 50,235tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 502,349tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.\r\nScenario existing prior to the implementation of the project (the same as baseline scenario):\r\nLFG from Mengzi landfill site is emitted to the atmosphere directly.\r\nEquivalent electricity generated by the project is supplied by the China Southern Power Grid, which is dominated by fossil fuel based power plants.","location":{"latitude":23.296347,"longitude":103.372183},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-05-25","endExclusive":"2022-06-25","endInclusive":"2022-06-24"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3011"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3011"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"50234"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.G."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"15/03/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/10/2021 - 30/09/2031"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=67120&IDKEY=j98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8dk92558480","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS 3011-Draft Project-Description-Mengzi-clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-05-25T12:31:01.43Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=63349&IDKEY=a903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdf087358271","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-Mengzi.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-03-15T01:37:07.18Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=86459&IDKEY=78723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq09119226961","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"PD Mengzi-Clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-03-15T07:44:41.33Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Projec